WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:11.272
Review the exact family. Confirm the school, family balance and existing charges. An invoice records an amount due; it is not a payment.

00:00:11.272 --> 00:00:22.544
Prepare the one-time invoice. Choose Family charge and Custom charge. Enter the approved amount and a specific description.

00:00:22.544 --> 00:00:33.816
Create once and read confirmation. Review the confirmation before proceeding. This training backend saves one synthetic invoice and cannot collect money.

00:00:33.816 --> 00:00:45.434
Reload the saved invoice. The local training receipt lists the invoice number, description, amount and open status. The stored example balance is now three hundred dollars.

00:00:45.434 --> 00:00:56.706
Verify before collection. Confirm one invoice and the intended due date. Review pending payments and parent authorization separately before any real collection.

